flowchart TD
    A[User: natural language input] --> B[Planner Agent<br/>Gemini]
    B --> C{Validator<br/>schema + guardrails}
    C -->|invalid| E[Rejected with reason<br/>logged, not scheduled]
    C -->|valid| F[Reviewer Agent<br/>Gemini]
    F -->|issues found, retry max 1| B
    F -->|approved| D[Adapter<br/>dicts to Task objects]
    D --> G[Greedy Scheduler<br/>existing PawPal+ logic]
    G --> H[DailyPlan output]
    B -.trace.-> L[(logs/agent_trace.jsonl)]
    C -.trace.-> L
    F -.trace.-> L
    G -.trace.-> L
    L --> I[Eval Harness]
    I --> J[Human review<br/>documented in model_card.md]